#: includes/admin/connection-page.php:531
msgid "<strong>Fill in the basics.</strong> <strong>Name:</strong> any name you like. <strong>Connection:</strong> keep <strong>Server URL</strong> selected and paste the URL. <strong>Authentication:</strong> <strong>OAuth</strong>."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/connection-page.php:534
msgid "<strong>Open Advanced OAuth settings.</strong> Set <strong>Registration method</strong> to <strong>Dynamic Client Registration (DCR)</strong>. The endpoints (Auth URL, Token URL, Registration URL, Resource) fill in automatically, so only check them. Tick <strong>Server supports PKCE (S256)</strong> and leave <strong>OIDC</strong> off. If ChatGPT says it could not discover the settings, use the manual values further down."
